-- (b): administering and enforcing a compromise made under the provision; restraining proceedings, appointing a temporary receiver and making rules once the Court has begun the administration.
#ASSERT `s 302(b) the Court of Chancery has the power` WITH `the power` IS `to administer and enforce a compromise or arrangement made pursuant to the provision`, `a compromise or arrangement was made pursuant to the provision contained in § 102(b)(2)` IS TRUE, `the Court of Chancery has begun the administration and enforcement of that provision with respect to the corporation` IS FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 302(b) the Court of Chancery has the power` WITH `the power` IS `to administer and enforce a compromise or arrangement made pursuant to the provision`, `a compromise or arrangement was made pursuant to the provision contained in § 102(b)(2)` IS FALSE, `the Court of Chancery has begun the administration and enforcement of that provision with respect to the corporation` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 302(b) the Court of Chancery has the power` WITH `the power` IS `to restrain, pendente lite, all actions and proceedings against the corporation`, `a compromise or arrangement was made pursuant to the provision contained in § 102(b)(2)` IS FALSE, `the Court of Chancery has begun the administration and enforcement of that provision with respect to the corporation` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 302(b) the Court of Chancery has the power` WITH `the power` IS `to restrain, pendente lite, all actions and proceedings against the corporation`, `a compromise or arrangement was made pursuant to the provision contained in § 102(b)(2)` IS TRUE, `the Court of Chancery has begun the administration and enforcement of that provision with respect to the corporation` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 302(b) the Court of Chancery has the power` WITH `the power` IS `to appoint a temporary receiver for the corporation and grant the receiver such powers as it deems proper`, `a compromise or arrangement was made pursuant to the provision contained in § 102(b)(2)` IS FALSE, `the Court of Chancery has begun the administration and enforcement of that provision with respect to the corporation` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 302(b) the Court of Chancery has the power` WITH `the power` IS `to make and enforce such rules as it deems necessary for the exercise of its jurisdiction`, `a compromise or arrangement was made pursuant to the provision contained in § 102(b)(2)` IS FALSE, `the Court of Chancery has begun the administration and enforcement of that provision with respect to the corporation` IS TRUE

§ `s 303 Proceeding under the Federal Bankruptcy Code of the United States; effectuation`

--  columns: corporation of this State, order for relief entered, action directed by decree or order, final decree entered
#ASSERT `s 303(a) the corporation may take the corporate action without further action by its directors or stockholders` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE, `an order for relief with respect to the corporation has been entered pursuant to the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS TRUE, `the corporate action is provided or directed by a decree or order of the court or judge in the bankruptcy proceeding` IS TRUE, `a final decree in the bankruptcy proceeding has been entered closing the case and discharging the trustee or trustees, if any` IS FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(a) the corporation may take the corporate action without further action by its directors or stockholders` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS FALSE, `an order for relief with respect to the corporation has been entered pursuant to the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS TRUE, `the corporate action is provided or directed by a decree or order of the court or judge in the bankruptcy proceeding` IS TRUE, `a final decree in the bankruptcy proceeding has been entered closing the case and discharging the trustee or trustees, if any` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(a) the corporation may take the corporate action without further action by its directors or stockholders` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE, `an order for relief with respect to the corporation has been entered pursuant to the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS FALSE, `the corporate action is provided or directed by a decree or order of the court or judge in the bankruptcy proceeding` IS TRUE, `a final decree in the bankruptcy proceeding has been entered closing the case and discharging the trustee or trustees, if any` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(a) the corporation may take the corporate action without further action by its directors or stockholders` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE, `an order for relief with respect to the corporation has been entered pursuant to the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS TRUE, `the corporate action is provided or directed by a decree or order of the court or judge in the bankruptcy proceeding` IS FALSE, `a final decree in the bankruptcy proceeding has been entered closing the case and discharging the trustee or trustees, if any` IS FALSE)
-- Subsection (d): the section ceases to apply on the final decree closing the case.
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(a) the corporation may take the corporate action without further action by its directors or stockholders` WITH `the corporation is a corporation of this State` IS TRUE, `an order for relief with respect to the corporation has been entered pursuant to the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS TRUE, `the corporate action is provided or directed by a decree or order of the court or judge in the bankruptcy proceeding` IS TRUE, `a final decree in the bankruptcy proceeding has been entered closing the case and discharging the trustee or trustees, if any` IS TRUE)
-- Who exercises the power: the trustees' majority where trustees are acting; otherwise designated officers or a representative of the court.
#ASSERT `s 303(a) the person may exercise the corporation’s power and take the corporate action` WITH `the person` IS `a majority of the trustees appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(a) the person may exercise the corporation’s power and take the corporate action` WITH `the person` IS `the designated officers of the corporation`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(a) the person may exercise the corporation’s power and take the corporate action` WITH `the person` IS `a representative appointed by the court or judge`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(a) the person may exercise the corporation’s power and take the corporate action` WITH `the person` IS `a majority of the trustees appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 303(a) the person may exercise the corporation’s power and take the corporate action` WITH `the person` IS `the designated officers of the corporation`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 303(a) the person may exercise the corporation’s power and take the corporate action` WITH `the person` IS `a representative appointed by the court or judge`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS FALSE
-- (b): each listed action may be taken in the manner of (a); a lease only "if permitted by law".
#ASSERT `s 303(b) the corporation may take the listed corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` WITH `the corporate action` IS `alter, amend or repeal its bylaws`, `the corporation may take corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the lease is permitted by law` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 303(b) the corporation may take the listed corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` WITH `the corporate action` IS `be dissolved`, `the corporation may take corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the lease is permitted by law` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `s 303(b) the corporation may take the listed corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` WITH `the corporate action` IS `merge or consolidate as permitted by this chapter`, `the corporation may take corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the lease is permitted by law` IS FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(b) the corporation may take the listed corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` WITH `the corporate action` IS `lease its property and franchises to any corporation`, `the corporation may take corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the lease is permitted by law` IS FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 303(b) the corporation may take the listed corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` WITH `the corporate action` IS `lease its property and franchises to any corporation`, `the corporation may take corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` IS TRUE, `the lease is permitted by law` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(b) the corporation may take the listed corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` WITH `the corporate action` IS `alter, amend or repeal its bylaws`, `the corporation may take corporate action in the manner provided in subsection (a)` IS FALSE, `the lease is permitted by law` IS TRUE)
-- Appraisal: none on a merger or consolidation under this section; for the other actions the subsection says nothing.
#ASSERT (`s 303(b) a stockholder has a statutory right of appraisal of the stockholder’s stock` WITH `the corporate action` IS `merge or consolidate as permitted by this chapter`) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 303(b) a stockholder has a statutory right of appraisal of the stockholder’s stock` WITH `the corporate action` IS `be dissolved`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 303(b) a stockholder has a statutory right of appraisal of the stockholder’s stock` WITH `the corporate action` IS `transfer all or part of its assets`) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT (`s 303(b) a stockholder has a statutory right of appraisal of the stockholder’s stock` WITH `the corporate action` IS `amend its certificate of incorporation, make any change in its capital or capital stock, or make any other amendment, change, alteration or provision authorized by this chapter`) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c): the instrument filed under section 103, made by the person (the trustees' majority, else officers or a representative), certifying the decree or order.
#ASSERT `s 303(c) the certificate, agreement or other instrument is in order` WITH `the instrument was filed with the Secretary of State in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE, `the person who made, executed and acknowledged the instrument` IS `a majority of the trustees appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS TRUE, `the instrument certifies that provision for its making is contained in a decree or order of a court or judge having jurisdiction of a proceeding under the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 303(c) the certificate, agreement or other instrument is in order` WITH `the instrument was filed with the Secretary of State in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE, `the person who made, executed and acknowledged the instrument` IS `the designated officers of the corporation`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS FALSE, `the instrument certifies that provision for its making is contained in a decree or order of a court or judge having jurisdiction of a proceeding under the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(c) the certificate, agreement or other instrument is in order` WITH `the instrument was filed with the Secretary of State in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE, `the person who made, executed and acknowledged the instrument` IS `the designated officers of the corporation`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS TRUE, `the instrument certifies that provision for its making is contained in a decree or order of a court or judge having jurisdiction of a proceeding under the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(c) the certificate, agreement or other instrument is in order` WITH `the instrument was filed with the Secretary of State in accordance with § 103` IS FALSE, `the person who made, executed and acknowledged the instrument` IS `a majority of the trustees appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS TRUE, `the instrument certifies that provision for its making is contained in a decree or order of a court or judge having jurisdiction of a proceeding under the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(c) the certificate, agreement or other instrument is in order` WITH `the instrument was filed with the Secretary of State in accordance with § 103` IS TRUE, `the person who made, executed and acknowledged the instrument` IS `a majority of the trustees appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding`, `trustees have been appointed or elected in the bankruptcy proceeding and are acting` IS TRUE, `the instrument certifies that provision for its making is contained in a decree or order of a court or judge having jurisdiction of a proceeding under the Federal Bankruptcy Code` IS FALSE)
-- (d): closing the case does not affect the validity of an act previously performed.
#ASSERT `s 303(d) the act previously performed remains valid` WITH `the act was performed pursuant to subsections (a) through (c) before the final decree` IS TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 303(d) the act previously performed remains valid` WITH `the act was performed pursuant to subsections (a) through (c) before the final decree` IS FALSE)
-- (e): the same fees as a corporation not in bankruptcy pays for a like paper.
#ASSERT (`s 303(e) the fee payable to the Secretary of State on filing the paper` WITH `the fee payable under § 391 by a corporation not in bankruptcy for the filing of a like paper` IS 75) EQUALS 75
